# Build output. `target/` here is multi-GB and `bundle/` holds a copied
# jeliyad; neither belongs in the repo. The root `.gitignore` anchors its
# `/target` and `/dist/` rules to the repo root, so they do NOT cover this
# directory — without this file `git add spikes/dioxus-desktop` stages
# everything. Mirrors `spikes/dioxus-web/.gitignore`.
target/
bundle/
evidence/
Cargo.lock.bak
